{"version":1,"content":"<p>德國警方周六（24日）表示，位於南部巴伐利亞州、納粹領袖希特勒（Adolf Hitler）的山間別墅「鷹巢」（Eagle's Nest）發生大火，消防人員趕抵現場時，整座建築物已完全陷入火海。</p><p>警方暫時拘留一名疑犯。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T08:03:01.311609+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T07:00:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T07:58:11.654815+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:58:11.654815+00:00","content_hash":"5101a8fdb6c04adaca1d2be522b31349d57d0769dd2ae5d27236b2aa50026ec6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}